#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#AEB: Autonomous Emergency Braking
#ACC: Automatic Cruise Control
#GVT: Global Vehicle Target
#VUT: Vehicle Under Test (ego vehicle)
#FCW: Forward Collision Warning
#LKAS: Lane-Keeping Assistance System
#
#The ACC example is used for ACC testing, tuning, and development, when prepareing for the ACC-specific Euro NCAP tests
#- This example is not part of the Euro NCAP test protocol
#- In this example the ego vehilce encounters a vehicle ahead and in its lane that is moving at a slower speed
#- The ego vehicle should automatically slow to the speed of the lead vehicle, while maintaining a safe stopping distance and desired time gap
#- A parked vehicle added to test ACC Radar perception robustness against false-positive detections in adjacent lanes
#
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

